WEBVTT

00:00:00.057 --> 00:00:04.732
1 · Add a greeting so you can compare the same design at different sizes.

00:00:04.732 --> 00:00:10.920
2 · Choose Tablet, then PC. Fit screen keeps the whole preview visible.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.079
3 · Expand canvas gives you more space. Press Escape to return to the editor.

00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:25.320
4 · Editor theme changes this tool’s colors. Your app’s own colors stay the same.
